        {
          "id": 1486146192,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "It does: https://gitlab.com/geraldcombs/update-ws-numbers/-/blob/main/.gitlab-ci.yml\n\nenterprises.c was updated on Saturday in 2d0a07116e, so there weren't any changes when the CI job ran on Sunday. The enterprises list is updated frequently, so this week's changes should show up this upcoming Sunday.\n\nSimilarly, services-data.c was updated on July 6 in 75a778e893. I don't think IANA updates the services list very often so there's no telling when changes will show up.",
